@startuml post-cheers-request
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/v1/cheers/request
caption CRB-37 · 재학생 → 현업자 커피챗 요청 저장 + 현업자 연락 설정으로 비동기 알림

actor Client
participant "UserGuard\n+ UserTypeGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "CheersStudentController" as Controller
participant "CheersStudentService" as Service
participant "StudentRepository" as StudentRepository
participant "GraduatedCardRepository" as GraduatedCardRepository
participant "CoffeeChatRequestRepository" as CoffeeChatRequestRepository
participant "NotificationService" as NotificationService
database PostgreSQL
participant "SMTP"
participant "Solapi"
participant "Slack"

Client -> Guard: POST /api/v1/cheers/request\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>\n{ graduated_id, message }
ref over Client, Guard
  UserGuard, UserTypeGuard — flow/auth-guards.puml
  @UserTypes(["student"]). 가입을 마친(active) 재학생만
  401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
  403 Signup is not completed / User type not allowed (현업자)
end ref
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt body 검증 실패 (graduated_id가 UUID가 아님,\nmessage가 trim 후 비었거나 1000자 초과)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: createRequest(req, user)
Controller -> Service: createRequest(userPk, req)

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> StudentRepository: findByUserPkWithLatestProfile(userPk, tx)
  StudentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT student\nLEFT JOIN LATERAL (student_profile ...\nORDER BY version DESC LIMIT 1)
  StudentRepository --> Service: { student, latest } | null
  alt 재학생 행 또는 추가 정보(latest)가 없음
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 403 Student profile not found
    note right: active 재학생은 항상 있으므로 방어 코드
  end

  Service -> GraduatedCardRepository: findRequestTarget(graduated_id, tx)
  GraduatedCardRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT g.pk, u.name, c.*\nFROM graduated g JOIN users u JOIN graduated_profile gp\nLEFT JOIN coffee_chat_contact c\nWHERE g.pk = ? AND u.type = 'graduated' AND u.status = 'active'\nAND isActiveAccount
  note right: 목록과 같은 조건.\n탈퇴 · 탈퇴 유예기간 중 · 가입 미완료 현업자는 없는 것으로 봄
  GraduatedCardRepository --> Service: { graduatedPk, name, contact | null } | null
  alt 현업자 없음
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Graduated not found
  else contact 없음, 또는 kakao_enabled · email_enabled 모두 false ("희망하지 않음")
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 409 Graduated does not accept coffee chat requests
  end

  Service -> CoffeeChatRequestRepository: insert({ graduatedPk, studentPk,\nstudentProfilePk: latest.profile.pk, message }, tx)
  CoffeeChatRequestRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT coffee_chat_request RETURNING *
  note right
    요청 당시의 재학생 정보 버전을 저장.
    복합 FK (student_profile_pk, student_pk) → 본인 버전만 들어감.
    같은 현업자에게 여러 번 요청 가능 (중복 검사 없음)
  end note
  CoffeeChatRequestRepository --> Service: request
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답

== 커밋 뒤 ==

Service -> Service: 켜진 채널만 담음\nemail_enabled → buildCoffeeChatRequestedMail(contact.email, name,\n  link = WEB_BASE_URL/cheers/received/<id>)\nkakao_enabled → { to: contact.phone,\n  variables: { recipientName: name, coffeeChatRequestPk } }
note right of Service
  WEB_BASE_URL: production에서 비어 있으면 서버 시작 실패,
  로컬에서 비어 있으면 링크 없이 발송.
  name이 null이면 "현업자"로 대체
end note
Service ->> NotificationService: notifyAsync({ coffeeChatRequestPk, event: "coffee_chat_requested", email?, alimtalk? })
note right
  응답을 기다리지 않음. 로그 insert가 트랜잭션 밖 connection에서
  coffee_chat_request FK를 참조하므로 반드시 커밋 뒤 호출
end note
Service --> Controller: { id, created_at }
Controller --> Client: 201 { id, created_at }

== 비동기 알림 (NotificationService.notify) ==

par 채널별 독립 발송
  NotificationService -> SMTP: MailService.send
  SMTP --> NotificationService: MailResult
else
  NotificationService -> Solapi: AlimtalkService.send (템플릿 coffee_chat_requested)
  Solapi --> NotificationService: AlimtalkResult
end
alt 실제 발송 안 함 (로컬 메일 · 솔라피 키 미설정 → skipped)
  note over NotificationService: notification_log 기록 안 함
else 발송 시도함
  NotificationService -> PostgreSQL: INSERT notification_log\n(event = coffee_chat_requested, channel, status sent | failed, recipient)
  opt 발송 실패 또는 로그 insert 실패
    NotificationService ->> Slack: [NOTIFICATION ERROR] (수신자 마스킹)
  end
end

@enduml
